  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(1)/(2+frac{1){3+(1)/(1+frac{1){4}}}}\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(1)/(2+frac{1){3+(1)/(1+frac{1){4}}}}\n\n= (1)/(2+frac{1){3+(1)/(frac{5){4}}}}\n\n= (1)/(2+frac{1){3+(4)/(5)}}\n\n= (1)/(2+frac{1){(19)/(5)}}\n\n= (1)/(2+frac{5){19}}\n\n= (1)/(frac{43){19}}\n\n= (19)/(43)\n\n**Hence, The Simplified value is (19)/(43).**",
